      R. Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَلْدَلَ</span></b> , (M,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَلْدَلَةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دِلْدَالٌ</span>,
